{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム対抗！乃木坂ガチ歌合戦！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\nかわたん、きい、れなちと4人で\nSPEEDさんの『BODY & SOUL』を\n歌わせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票により\n青チーム勝ちました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票してくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズ！スタッフ１００人くらいに聞きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし中田でアンケートとってたら\nどうだったんだろうと思ったけど\n特に出てこないだろうなって思ったら\n悲しくなってきたので考えるのやめました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんの意見が一番怖い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、一番気になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝まで乃木坂人狼！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田的には人生初人狼でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当日にルール教えてもらったけど\nまだ1回もやってなかったから\nルールを理解できてるか不安で\nドキドキしてましたが\n楽しくできました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勘は外れまくってたけど..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回やったけど\n2回ともガチ市民だったので\n今度は何かの役職でやってみたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、仮眠とってたよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で46時間TVも\n終わっちゃうのか～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しくなるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/12/9479964/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}